8901","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"We propose an efficient unconditionally secure protocol for privacy preserving comparison of ℓ-bit integers when both integers are shared between two semi-honest parties. Using our comparison protocol as a building block, we construct two-party generic private machine learning classifiers. In this scenario, one party holds an input while the other holds a model and they wish to classify the input according to the model without revealing their private information to each other. Our constructions are based on the setup assumption that there exists pre-distributed correlated randomness available to the computing parties, the so-called commodity-based model. The protocols are storage and computationally efficient, consisting only of additions and multiplications of integers.","author_count":6,"contributors":["David, Bernardo Machado","Dowsley, Rafael","Katti, Raj","Nascimento, Anderson C A"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-202058"],"event":{"end":"2016-01-26","place":"Kanazawa, jp","start":"2015-11-24","title":"9th International Conference, ProvSec 2015","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["Dowsley, Rafael"],"country":["Germany","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Karlsruhe Institute of Technology","University of Washington"],"keyword":["Unconditional security"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"efficient unconditionally secure comparison and privacy preserving machine learning classification protocols","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84948800105","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-202058","identifier":[{"id":"84948800105","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-7f1ae5b0-db1f-4711-9373-00be32be6285"],"keyword":["Commodity based model","Private machine learning","Secure comparison","Unconditional security"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F6C2DF7BD2E5B3B90CC14DBF3343160B"],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"karlsruhe institute of technology","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Karlsruhe Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"us","key":"university of washington","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"University of Washington","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bernardo","key":"davidpau","last":"David","locid":"e39dd946-3171-4c2c-acc2-0990fe5230b3","name":"David, Bernardo Machado","name_org":"David, Bernardo","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rafael","key":"dowsleypau","last":"Dowsley","name":"Dowsley, Rafael","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Raj","key":"kattipau","last":"Katti","name":"Katti, Raj","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anderson C A","key":"nascimentopau","last":"Nascimento","name":"Nascimento, Anderson C A","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Man-Ho","key":"aupedh","last":"Au","name":"Au, Man-Ho","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Atsuko","key":"miyajipedh","last":"Miyaji","name":"Miyaji, Atsuko","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-26059-4_20","eisbn":["9783319260594"],"isbn":["9783319260587"],"issn":["03029743"],"pages":"354-367","publisher":"Springer VS","series":"Lecture Notes in Computer Science","status":"p","subtitle":"9th International Conference, ProvSec 2015, Kanazawa, Japan, November 24-26, 2015, Proceedings","title":"Provable Security","volume":"9451"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84948800105"],"search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-7f1ae5b0-db1f-4711-9373-00be32be6285"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Efficient unconditionally secure comparison and privacy preserving machine learning classification protocols","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-202058","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Oblivious transfer (OT) is a fundamental two-party cryptographic primitive that implies secure multiparty computation. In this paper, we introduce the first OT based on the Learning Parity with Noise (LPN) problem. More specifically, we use the LPN variant that was introduced by Alekhnovich (FOCS 2003). We prove that our protocol is secure against active static adversaries in the Universal Composability framework in the common reference string model. Our constructions are based solely on a LPN style assumption and thus represents a clear next step from current code-based OT protocols, which require an additional assumption related to the indistinguishability of public keys from random matrices. Our constructions are inspired by the techniques used to obtain OT based on the McEliece cryptosystem.","author_count":6,"contributors":["David, Bernardo Machado","Dowsley, Rafael","Nascimento, Anderson C A"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-173227"],"event":{"acronym":"CANS","end":"2014-10-24","place":"Heraklion, Crete, gr","start":"2014-10-22","title":"International Conference on Cryptology and Network Security","year":"2014"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, South","Europe, EU","OECD"],"corresponding_author":["David, Bernardo Machado"],"country":["Brazil","Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Karlsruhe Institute of Technology","Universidade de Brasilia"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"universally composable oblivious transfer based on a variant of lpn","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-12280-9_10","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-173227","identifier":[{"id":"84911418729","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["au-4d15e2d2-0848-4e0b-9782-3581305a6ecd"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FC3817AEAED71D2FB8CD7C59E719FBF4"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"http://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007%2F978-3-319-12280-9_10","version":"Other Version"},{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1007/978-3-319-12280-9_10","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2014","yearSub":"2014"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"karlsruhe institute of technology","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Karlsruhe Institute of Technology","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"br","key":"universidade de brasilia","loc":["Brazil","America, South"],"name":"Universidade de Brasilia","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Bernardo Machado","key":"davidpau","last":"David","locid":"e39dd946-3171-4c2c-acc2-0990fe5230b3","name":"David, Bernardo Machado","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rafael","key":"dowsleypau","last":"Dowsley","name":"Dowsley, Rafael","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Anderson C A","key":"nascimentopau","last":"Nascimento","name":"Nascimento, Anderson C A","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Dimitris","key":"gritzalispedh","last":"Gritzalis","name":"Gritzalis, Dimitris","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Aggelos","key":"kiayiaspedh","last":"Kiayias","name":"Kiayias, Aggelos","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publicatio